      "title": "Start here - generate from the Timeline app",
      "widgets_values": [
        "DUAL SWITCH REF2VA TEST WORKFLOW\n\nIn LongCaster: Generation settings shows Model source and Acceleration. Production settings can save defaults for this workflow.\n\nModel A: full native REF2VA checkpoint. Model B: FL2VA plus MiniMaxH3RefPatchLoader, an EXPERIMENTAL approximation; not native REF2VA. Requires ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3_Ref-Patch and minimax_h3_ref_patch.safetensors in models/model_patches. Select actual installed checkpoint filenames in both loaders. No files are downloaded automatically.\n\nAcceleration A: HyperFlow 8-step native SIGMAS with Euler, no extra sigma shift. Requires the full node-build HyperFlow adapter. Acceleration B: PDD ACC 8-step native SIGMAS with Euler, video/audio shifts 12/3. Acceleration C: Standard REF2VA without an acceleration adapter, 20 steps, res_multistep sampler, simple scheduler, video/audio shifts 12/3. Comfy Kitchen is used on all three paths.\n\nOnly the selected source and acceleration branch are queued. Both choices are frozen in each take. Model/patch combinations require GPU testing; selecting a compatible socket does not prove output quality.\n\nMissing node packs/files, invalid switch selections and incompatible socket definitions are reported in the generation panel and block generation. Change defaults in Production after replacing a workflow or changing switch identities. Keep the original ComfyUI tab open.\n\nReference patch source: https://github.com/lihaoyun6/ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3_Ref-Patch\nHyperFlow: existing authorized ComfyUI-HyperFlow-H3 installation. No prompt skips, drift changes or automatic last-frame references."
      ]
    }
